{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"movie/16859","tmdb_id":16859,"title":"魔女宅急便","original_title":"魔女の宅急便","overview":"琪琪今年13岁了，按照魔法界的规矩，魔法少女年满13岁就要出外进行为期一年的修行。所以琪琪带着宠物黑猫吉吉踏上了修行之旅。然而，修行之旅开识得并不顺利，当琪琪来到海边一座大城市时，人们并没有欢迎她的到来，人人都不搭理她。幸亏琪琪有一颗善良的心，当她拾到了一件别人的失物时，热心的琪琪找到了失主。她的善良赢得了面包店老板娘的好感，琪琪就在面包店开始了她用飞行魔法为客人服务的快递业务。琪琪很快适应了新环境，一次，一个热衷于飞机制造的男孩邀请琪琪去参加飞行俱乐部的聚会，途中琪琪因为帮一位老大娘送东西而被雨淋了。从此，琪琪突然发现自己的魔法正在一天天变弱。","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oFouL0QtqVjGP6JutSCYpY4AM5b.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5pAEVma835u8xoE60kmLVopLct.jpg","release_date":"1989-07-29","year":"1989","runtime":"103 minutes","tmdb_rating_average":7.835,"tmdb_votes":4559,"tmdb_rating":"7.835 / 10 from 4559 users","genres":["动画","家庭","奇幻"],"languages":["Japanese"],"countries":["Japan"],"production_companies":["Studio Ghibli","Nibariki","Tokuma Shoten","Nippon Television Network Corporation"],"directors":[{"name":"宫崎骏","id":608}],"producers":[{"name":"宫崎骏","id":608}],"cast":[{"id":68470,"name":"高山南","original_name":"高山みなみ","character":"Kiki / Ursula (voice)","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/4Gunxt2UWnAX74ZoXKtqK2rI0e.jpg"},{"id":218144,"name":"佐久间丽","original_name":"佐久間レイ","character":"Jiji (voice)","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/6M6zQtO0reIv97oKUrVT084FUKv.jpg"},{"id":68472,"name":"山口胜平","original_name":"山口勝平","character":"Tombo (voice)","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/mJyxKRZxLv9D7LH5KcNSkjSKYOB.jpg"},{"id":57736,"name":"户田惠子","original_name":"戸田恵子","character":"Osono (voice)","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/jRJIfQLmMyHaNnvlBnnNp3kPx6I.jpg"},{"id":552598,"name":"信泽三惠子","original_name":"信澤三惠子","character":"Kokiri (voice)","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/znTqIdwtD6EyRMgMOVN67sKzFZa.jpg"},{"id":552599,"name":"三浦浩一","original_name":"三浦浩一","character":"Okino (voice)","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/8dUuWI8